{"id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-rel-mlrandom.md","title":"相对 Martin-Löf 随机性","display":"df-rel-mlrandom — 相对 Martin-Löf 随机性","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-rel-mlrandom"],"display":"df-rel-mlrandom — 相对 Martin-Löf 随机性","label":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-mltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.7及Corollary 9.7.4，印刷189–191，PDF209–211","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-rel-mlrandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rel-mlrandom — 相对 Martin-Löf 随机性"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-rel-mlrandom"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.7及Corollary 9.7.4，印刷189–191，PDF209–211"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}^{B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}\\)</span> 为下式定义的、以集合或特征序列预言机为参数的谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{A}(X)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(U)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>预言机参数先由 AsSet 转换为自然数集合；集合与其特征序列给出同一个随机性谓词。相对化作用于统一枚举算法，公平硬币测度保持为检验定义中固定的测度。</p>\n<p>书目定位沿用附件的 §9.7、Corollary 9.7.4，印刷页 189–191、PDF 页 209–211；本轮核查参数类型和内部依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"4