bb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]。固定 $U:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{<\\omega}$，满足 [[43-df-universal-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"c03c10d191232ac0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；相对随机性见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$，$X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，$B^{(k)}$ 采用 [[43-df-jump]] 的自然数迭代跳跃，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。下式定义由正整数 $n$ 索引的随机性谓词及其相对形式。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]] — 相对 Martin-Löf 随机性"},{"id":"bc364bc25acb62b0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-2random]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-thm-lowforml-equiv]]。"},{"id":"574b0b43d52660b1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；各定义见 [[43-df-arith-random]]、[[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"5c5d5e9dd48a36f0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-reldim]]、[[43-df-effhausdim]]、[[43-df-effpackdim]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]。"},{"id":"d58a8fe240a8ca83","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$；定义见 [[43-df-nrandom]]、[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"9f7485d8c26815d3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$\\Omega_U^A$ 采用 [[43-df-omega-operator]]，$\\operatorname{LeftComputable}$、$\\opera